			"notes": "This updates the beta to version 1.0.0-beta.4.\nOnly a bunch of backend changes, some invisible logic for daily commissions and title rendering whenever a commission is done.\nChangelog:\n- Added some flair whenever commissions are complied\n- Added CommissionCompletedEvent to hook onto\n- Modified a bunch of daily commission properties so they are not trivial and not too tight\n- Clean up of some documentation and code\n- Updated beta version"
