			"notes": "This is the release for Building Journal v1.0.0-beta.3 for Forge 1.20.1!\n\nBelow is the list of changes:\n\n- Added support for potential default condition titles shown on hover (this I think is currently unecessary and removes some fun interactions)\n- Added fallback when using shader loaders like Iris/Occulus\n- Added a \"drop shadow\" to commission text lines\n- Added advancements for default commissions (including a new advancement trigger)\n- Modified the default commissions to reward XP\n- Updated commission setup to check for default versioning beforehand\n- Updated default condition titles and failure descriptions to be more human-readable\n- Changed how Shader Variants show up in config instead of being a manual input\n- Added a small API method for devs to be able to insert their own Daily Commission constructors\n- Fixed checkbox sizing in commissions being a little too big\n- Fixed minor semantic (and stupid as hell) bug with length condition evals\n- Fixed bug where if you tried to check a blueprint with no diffed changes at all in a commission with tallness, length or elevation conditions the game would crash\n- Fixed a bug where closing a commission would return to the wrong page in the journal UI\n- Updated beta version"
		},
